WEBVTT

00:40.165 --> 00:45.508
A thousand miles of winter grey Another dawn,

00:45.528 --> 00:51.871
another day The engines hum, a weary soul A heavy

00:52.051 --> 00:57.573
price, a heavy toll I see your face on frozen

00:57.673 --> 01:03.795
glass A man that's built to last A single light

01:03.895 --> 01:11.137
that I must find To leave the endless dark behind

01:11.837 --> 01:18.599
And the lights are bright On this winter's night

01:18.659 --> 01:24.341
Because you're coming home Yes, you're finally

01:24.401 --> 01:30.466
coming home Through the wind and rain Through

01:30.486 --> 01:38.313
the doubt and pain You are not alone No, you're

01:38.453 --> 01:45.660
finally No, you're finally coming

01:48.522 --> 01:56.428
home Jumps that ladder, about to be erased. Up

01:56.548 --> 02:02.053
and down, tumble and a whispered vow. Feels so

02:02.173 --> 02:06.757
close, it's coming now. The fire's lit, the

02:06.837 --> 02:12.882
table's set. A promise that I haven't met. But in

02:12.922 --> 02:17.566
my heart, the feeling grows. A warmth that melts

02:17.686 --> 02:19.207
the winter snow.

02:21.949 --> 02:28.713
And the lights are bright On this winter's night

02:28.793 --> 02:34.476
Because you're coming home Yes, you're finally

02:34.517 --> 02:40.720
coming home Through the wind and rain Through

02:40.780 --> 02:48.465
the doubt and pain You are not alone No, you're

02:48.605 --> 02:50.726
finally coming

02:55.773 --> 02:56.293
Thank you.

